{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20498","headline":"夏日可畏 · 张籍","name":"夏日可畏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赫赫温风扇，炎炎夏日徂。\n火威驰逈野，畏景铄遥途。\n势矫翔阳翰，功分造化罏。\n禁城千品烛，黄道一轮孤。\n落照频空簟，余晖卷夕梧。\n如何倦游子，中路独踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}